  "locked_test_may_select_candidate": false
 },
 "controller": {
  "search_budget_units": 8
 },
 "notes": "Tree search over task-agent candidates from A0 (HGM-style Thompson sampling, alpha/tau as below); search feedback = repair-set strict improvement of the target over the actual parent; the two best candidates on the repair set are then validated with clinevolve.gates_exp2 (earlier gate specification: comparison with the actual parent, 2 pp workflow and 0.2 pp tool margins, no new-regression gate) or clinevolve.gates (G1-G6)."
}